[hot] 心跳次数=3 其中被「嵌套事务」拒绝=3       ← 热重载后：全灭
[hot] 事务外调用 runExclusive：成功             ← 证明事务外没问题，是上下文被钉住了

同一份插件代码，冷启动 0 次失败，热重载后 100% 失败。

根因
dsh-hmr/lib/index.js：
// :740
executing = new AsyncLocalStorage()

// :752-760
runExclusive(operation) {
  if (this.executing.getStore())
    return Promise.reject(new Error('HMR transactions cannot be nested'))   // ← :753 被自己拒绝
  const task = this.operations.then(async () => {
    if (this.closing) throw new Error('HMR is disposed')
    return this.executing.run(true, operation)                              // ← :756
  })
  this.operations = task.catch(() => {})
  return task
